  "hero_summary_zh": "无比致命又异常脆弱，天怒法师操控强大的魔法对敌人发动狂轰滥炸，将他们快速消灭。敌人经他沉默后对魔法全无抵抗，也就是说谁敢反抗他都会被轻而易举地汽化。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Deadly and fragile in equal measure, Skywrath Mage quickly destroys his enemies with a barrage of powerful magic. He silences foes while increasing their vulnerability to spells, meaning he has no trouble vaporizing any who stand against him.",
