    {
      "name": "skywrath_mage_arcane_bolt",
      "id": 5581,
      "name_zh": "奥法鹰隼",
      "name_en": "Arcane Bolt",
      "description_zh": "天怒法师施放出缓慢移动的奥术鹰群，对敌方单位造成基于天怒法师智力值的伤害。",
      "description_en": "Skywrath Mage launches a slow-moving bolt of arcane magic, dealing damage to an enemy unit based on Skywrath Mage's intelligence.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "鹰群移动得非常缓慢（500移速），提供325范围的视野。击中目标后，将给予目标区域的视野，持续3.34秒。",
        "奥法鹰隼无法被躲避。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "The projectile moves very slowly (500 ms), providing 325 vision around it.  Upon impact, it will reveal the target area for 3.34 seconds.",
        "Arcane Bolt cannot be disjointed."
      ],
